The provenance trail of this Oracle: every paper and
study in the order it arrived, the numbers it moved, and
the restructuring passes where they fell. Dates are the
days of taking-in. A study takes no Novelty Index and
does not move the Oracle (rule 12): the Oracle prices the
paper stream, and a study is not sampled from it. The
full records stand in the source index (1.1.3) and the
Oracle ledger (1.1.4); this scroll is the trail walked in
one pass.

